  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;be a root of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3033</mn></msup></math> is equal to:",
    "image": null
  },
