  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Using the formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and imaginary.</p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3033</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
